{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03346",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 4.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.89,
      "end_seconds": 8.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Mm, hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.3,
      "end_seconds": 11.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.82,
      "end_seconds": 22.16,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Mainly a red sore wound after my operation. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.77,
      "end_seconds": 26.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.8,
      "end_seconds": 34.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Since last weekend, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.52,
      "end_seconds": 37.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Mm, okay. What eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.73,
      "end_seconds": 42.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "I, I get some relief from dressing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.24,
      "end_seconds": 46.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.0,
      "end_seconds": 49.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.83,
      "end_seconds": 69.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "So, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.34,
      "end_seconds": 72.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.95,
      "end_seconds": 74.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.72,
      "end_seconds": 78.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.97,
      "end_seconds": 83.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.86,
      "end_seconds": 88.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.48,
      "end_seconds": 91.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.37,
      "end_seconds": 97.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.34,
      "end_seconds": 108.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.02,
      "end_seconds": 110.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.46,
      "end_seconds": 116.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any breathlessness or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.21,
      "end_seconds": 119.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.38,
      "end_seconds": 125.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any calf pain or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.82,
      "end_seconds": 128.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.52,
      "end_seconds": 136.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.57,
      "end_seconds": 143.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.63,
      "end_seconds": 157.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.22,
      "end_seconds": 169.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.32,
      "end_seconds": 197.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "Okay: height 181 centimetres, temperature 38.9, pulse is 98 beats a minute, saturation 98 percent, blood pressure 106 over 73, weight 79 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.21,
      "end_seconds": 202.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.02,
      "end_seconds": 206.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Okay, does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.63,
      "end_seconds": 225.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "The lower part of the wound is red, hot and weeping pus, and the edges have not come together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.42,
      "end_seconds": 238.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So, based on the history and the examination, this is probably a surgical wound infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.76,
      "end_seconds": 242.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.91,
      "end_seconds": 254.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a surgical wound infection, and we'll know more once the a wound swab is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.93,
      "end_seconds": 270.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "A wound swab is what I'd like next, for wound infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 271.25,
      "end_seconds": 273.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "The earliest is Thursday, 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.45,
      "end_seconds": 287.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.92,
      "text": "For this, flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day, seven days. That should help with wound infection. Keep it clean and dry and use fresh dressings daily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.58,
      "end_seconds": 301.16,
      "duration_seconds": 13.58,
      "text": "Yes. Let's hold off on blood tests for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.0,
      "end_seconds": 310.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "So, I take the flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.37,
      "end_seconds": 318.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.28,
      "end_seconds": 324.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}